{"id":"063b60d9acc5d2bd","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-d-simple.md","title":"d-simple 集合的差数组定义","display":"df-d-simple — d-simple 集合的差数组定义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-d-simple","aliases":["20-df-d-simple"],"display":"df-d-simple — d-simple 集合的差数组定义","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"external-primary","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"[Lerman–Soare, d-simple sets, small sets, and degree classes (1980), Definition 1.1, p.138](https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf)","external_pdf_pages":[5],"external_printed_pages":[138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-d-simple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-d-simple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-d-simple — d-simple 集合的差数组定义"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"external-primary"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"<a href=\"https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lerman–Soare, d-simple sets, small sets, and degree classes (1980), Definition 1.1, p.138</a>"},{"key":"external_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>5</span></div>"},{"key":"external_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A=\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(\\overline A=\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}d\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\land|\\overline A|=\\omega\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\exists Y\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[Y\\subseteq X\\land X\\cap\\overline A=Y\\cap\\overline A\\land\n\\forall Z\\in\\mathcal E\\ (|Z\\setminus X|=\\omega\\Rightarrow(Z\\setminus Y)\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}d\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\land|\\overline A|=\\omega\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\exists Y\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[Y\\subseteq X\\land X\\cap\\overline A=Y\\cap\\overline A\\land\n\\forall Z\\in\\mathcal E\\ (|Z\\setminus X|=\\omega\\Rightarrow(Z\\setminus Y)\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原论文预先约定所有集合均为 c.e.；本目录还会在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 的一般上下文中调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\)</span>，因此把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span> 明写进定义本体，给出全域的一元性质谓词。已目视核对原论文第 138 页的补集横线；第一交式确实涉及补集，第二式涉及 A。旧稿仅要求所有余无限 c.e. 超集简单，这对任意 simple A 已成立，不能定义 d-simple。该概念不在 Soare 2016 第 12 章；使用原论文补足来源。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lerman–Soare, d-simple sets, small sets, and degree classes (1980), Definition 1.1, p.138</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A=\\omega\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}d\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\land|\\overline A|=\\omega\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\exists Y\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[Y\\subseteq X\\land X\\cap\\overline A=Y\\cap\\overline A\\land\n\\forall Z\\in\\mathcal E\\ (|Z\\setminus X|=\\omega\\Rightarrow(Z\\setminus Y)\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing)].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal E","display":false}],"bytes":1836,"backlinks":[{"id":"511b2c0cef24bfb9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-d-simple]]；see [[20-df-simple]]。"},{"id":"ab77f0806f900cb2","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hh-simple]]；see [[20-df-hypersimple]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-d-simple]]；see [[20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-443","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-d-simple]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-443","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-d-simple]]"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc"]}